-- Companion to ../embedded-wins/main.l4 (LIBRARY-RESOLUTION-SHADOW-SPEC).
--
-- Here a project-local prelude.l4 sits beside the importing file. The B′
-- ordering must still let it win over the embedded stdlib: this file uses
-- `shadow marker`, which only the local override defines, so the check
-- succeeds iff the project-scoped copy was chosen.
IMPORT prelude

check MEANS `shadow marker`
